RevengeProtect
--------------

Binary protector CLI (`RevengeProtect.exe`) based on VMProtect 3.x, customized for the Revenge toolchain.

Building & regenerating the embedded x64 runtime (`core\win_runtime64.dll.inc`):
    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\build_runtime.ps1

Manual MSBuild commands (Windows, x64):
    msbuild vcproj\VMProtectSDK.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Release;Platform=x64;PlatformToolset=v145 /m
    msbuild vcproj\win_runtime.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Release;Platform=x64;PlatformToolset=v145 /m
    msbuild vcproj\VMProtectCon.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Ultimate;Platform=x64;PlatformToolset=v145 /m

Outputs:
    bin\64\Ultimate\RevengeProtect.exe
    bin\64\Release\VMProtectSDK64.dll
